  "summary_en": "Kenya's national AI strategy for 2025-2030 aims to make the country Africa's AI hub. It rests on three pillars (AI digital infrastructure, data, AI research and innovation) and four enablers (governance, talent, investment, ethics and inclusion). It proposes a national AI policy, an agile governance framework, data sovereignty and cybersecurity measures. It has no robotics-specific content.",
